<!--
  The shared vocabulary: the words that appear on more than one screen.

  Sport names live here rather than beside a feed card because three screens render them — the
  feed, the detail top bar and the archive — and a sport that reads "Cycling" in one place and
  "Заезд" in another is the same class of defect as a distance that disagrees with itself.

  A sport is looked up by its slug through `HealthHubIcons`'s neighbour `sportName`, and an
  unlisted slug falls back to the slug itself rather than to nothing: Principle VI says a type
  the app cannot name is still a type it must not hide.
-->
